#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:2211-6
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "<span class=\"ui\">View mode:</span> If you change to <span "
#| "class=\"ui\">continuous</span> mode you can scroll the document like a "
#| "web page. This mode is more suitable for non e-ink screen types (LCD, "
