"TOP MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_tools.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / Profiles / New with current book settings"
msgstr ""
"MENU SUPERIOR / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_tools. svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / Perfis / Novo com as definições actuais do documento"

